"{ph0}الثوابت:{ph1} الأرقام الثابتة المخزنة في البرنامج ، وقراءة بايت الخام "
"وفك الشفرة."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:255
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Three pieces of evidence, one calculation"
msgstr "ثلاث أدلة ، حساب واحد"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:259
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}01 · Instructions{ph1}{ph2}An integer input{ph3}{ph4}A stack read "
"supplies the value used by the floating-point instructions.{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01 * تعليمات{ph1}{ph2}إدخال عدد صحيح{ph3}{ph4}توفر قراءة المكدس القيمة "
"المستخدمة بواسطة تعليمات الفاصلة العائمة.{ph5}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: <code>20 + 30 × tile_x</code>
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:267
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Caller{ph1}{ph2}A screen coordinate{ph3}{ph4}The brick-hit caller "
"passes {ph5}.{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 * الدالة المستدعية{ph1}{ph2}تنسيق الشاشة{ph3}{ph4}وظيفة ضرب الطوب "
"التي تستدعي هذه الوظيفة تمر {ph5}.{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: <code>1.5625</code>
#. {ph6}: <code>500.0</code>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:275
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Data bytes{ph1}{ph2}The numeric constants{ph3}{ph4}Referenced "
"bytes decode to {ph5}, {ph6} and a scale value.{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 * بايت البيانات{ph1}{ph2}الثوابت الرقمية{ph3}{ph4}بايت المشار إليها "
"فك شفرة ل {ph5}, {ph6} وقيمة مقياس.{ph7}"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:287
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA supplies the instructions, call relationship and bytes. The agent "
"interprets them together."
msgstr "REA لوازم التعليمات ، والعلاقة الدعوة وبايت. الوكيل يفسر لهم معا."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:294
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Ask about the behavior"
msgstr "اسأل عن السلوك"

