#: website/public/index.html:409
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "01 · Which branch?"
msgstr "01 * أي فرع?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/index.html:410
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} Two jumps to the same place. Which operators are "
"these?”"
msgstr ""
"“{ph0}0/5 ب? 0 * 5 ج?{ph1} اثنين يقفز إلى نفس المكان. التي مشغلي هذه?”"

#: website/public/index.html:414
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Look up the command IDs, then label the branch."
msgstr "ابحث عن معرفات الأوامر ، ثم قم بتسمية الفرع."

#: website/public/index.html:420
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide ÷"
msgstr "تقسيم ÷"

#: website/public/index.html:424
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Multiply ×"
msgstr "ضرب ×"

#: website/public/index.html:429
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "02 · What do the calls do?"
msgstr "02 · ماذا تفعل الدوال المستدعاة؟"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/index.html:430
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“100 is clear. The calls are just addresses. {ph0}Which one divides? Which "
"value goes in?{ph1}”"
msgstr ""
"\"100 واضح. المكالمات هي مجرد عناوين. {ph0}أي واحد يقسم? القيمة التي يذهب "
"في?{ph1}”"

#: website/public/index.html:435
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Inspect the helpers and trace the stored values."
msgstr "افحص وظائف المساعد وتتبع القيم المخزنة."

#: website/public/index.html:445
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide"
msgstr "تقسيم"

#: website/public/index.html:450
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "03 · What is the rule?"
msgstr "03 * ما هي القاعدة?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/index.html:451
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“This path multiplies by the other input. So {ph0}10% means 10% of 200{ph1} "
"after +.”"
msgstr ""
"\"يتضاعف هذا المسار من خلال المدخلات الأخرى. لذا {ph0}10 ٪ تعني 10 ٪ من "
"200{ph1} بعد +.”"

#: website/public/index.html:455
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Name the operands and check both operator paths."
msgstr "قم بتسمية المعاملات وتحقق من كلا مساري المشغل."

#: website/public/index.html:471 website/public/index.html:399
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Illustrative expert reasoning"
msgstr "منطق الخبراء التوضيحي"

