msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA to inspect this dinosaur game. Why does it get "
"faster? Show the speed rule, then build a small version with an adjustable "
"speed.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}استخدام REA لتفقد هذه اللعبة ديناصور. لماذا لا تحصل على "
"أسرع? عرض قاعدة السرعة ، ثم بناء نسخة صغيرة مع سرعة قابل "
"للتعديل.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://wayou.github.io/t-rex-runner/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/index.html:683
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Inspected target: {ph0}wayou’s Chromium-derived browser edition{ph1}."
msgstr "الهدف الذي تم فحصه: {ph0}وايو Chromium- مستمد متصفح الطبعة{ph1}."

