msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"To inspect the target yourself, follow the {ph0}browser connection "
"steps{ph1} using {ph2}the dinosaur page{ph3}. Give your agent that page URL "
"and your local debugging endpoint, then copy the prompt above."
